{"thread":{"threadID":3355,"boardID":117,"topic":"Teamspeak3/Crashes - Statement","time":1454578623,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","lastPostTime":1455881893,"lastPoster":"Sky","replies":22,"views":1924,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":5},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":43645,"threadID":3355,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"Teamspeak3/Crashes - Statement","time":1454578623,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":5,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","time":1454579215,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1454584392,"value":1},{"userID":2086,"username":"sPredz","time":1454612312,"value":1},{"userID":1746,"username":"ArrowStorm","time":1455292708,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1456783399,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Unser Teamspeak³ Server crasht seit 4-5 Tagen in einem Zeitintervall von 3-9 Stunden ~<br>(Jeder auf dem Server erhält einen Timeout und der Server muss anschließend manuell neugestartet werden)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir sind sämtliche Optionen durch gegangen, haben sogar den kompletten Server neu aufgesetzt, aber nichts scheint zu helfen.<br>Die Logs helfen und auch nicht weiter, denn Error-Logs sind nicht vorhanden.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Bis auf weiteres wird dieses Problem wohl bestehen. Die Ursache ist nach wie vor <u>unbekannt</u><br>Wir bleiben aber dran und geben unser bestes, das Problem ausfindig zu machen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43648,"threadID":3355,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1454589008,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1454589828,"value":1},{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1455191007,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vielleicht D-Dos?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43649,"threadID":3355,"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","subject":"","time":1454589854,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>neoN</strong></cite><p>Vielleicht D-Dos?<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich glaub dann gäbe es aber ne Nachricht vom Anbieter.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43650,"threadID":3355,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1454590041,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1454590087,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>neoN</strong></cite><p>Vielleicht D-Dos?<br></p></blockquote><p>Nein, der Server / Root bleibt online, jedoch kann sich lediglich keiner mehr draufconnecten. Es gibt auch keine Anzeichen von DDoS Angriffen, die CPU Ausleistung ist beim Absturz gering, niemand fängt an zu laggen im TeamSpeak etc.<br>Jeder Client kriegt lediglich einen Timeout und kann sich auch nach 10 Stunden (falls der TeamSpeak Prozess nicht neugestartet wird) nicht reconnecten.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43651,"threadID":3355,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1454590385,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vieleicht Root neu aufsetzen ?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43652,"threadID":3355,"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","subject":"","time":1454591315,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1454591666,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es hört sich fast nach einem Portfehler an vielleich stürtzt ein Dienst auf dem Rootserver ab der für die Verbindungsherstellung/erhaltung wichtig ist.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43958,"threadID":3355,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1455189377,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Der Teamspeak³ weist immernoch den gleichen Fehler auf.<br>Wir versuchen etwas neues zu testen um das Problem zu lösen, weshalb unser TS3 für 1-2 Tage mit einem Passwort geschützt ist. Weitere Infos werden in diesem Thema bekanntgegeben.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43961,"threadID":3355,"userID":112,"username":"Minimal is Criminal","subject":"","time":1455198461,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1455641159,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>ich kann es einfach nicht verstehen mein liebster kevin</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":43999,"threadID":3355,"userID":1746,"username":"ArrowStorm","subject":"","time":1455278757,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1455280284,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ist der ts mittlerweile komplett down? werde sofort drauf hingewiesen das die verbindung fehlgeschlagen ist</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44000,"threadID":3355,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1455280445,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>liest du überhaupt ? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span> sky hat zwei Posts über dir geschrieben das n pw drin is :3</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44003,"threadID":3355,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1455284641,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich wette einer ddost aber ihr rafft es nicht <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span> Kappapride</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44005,"threadID":3355,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1455285919,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Senpai</strong></cite><p>Ich wette einer ddost aber ihr rafft es nicht <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😛</span> Kappapride<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich kann dir bestätigen, dass dies nicht der Fall ist.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44007,"threadID":3355,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1455289167,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2111,"username":"Baumi (gesperrt)","time":1455291440,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es muss nicht gleich eine (D)DoS-Attacke sein. Es gibt/gab auch genug TS3-Exploits/Flooder/etc.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44008,"threadID":3355,"userID":1746,"username":"ArrowStorm","subject":"","time":1455292674,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Craxto du busch klar hab ichs mitbekommen aber ich werd nicht mehr nachm pw gefragt sonder direkt abgewiesen ._.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44010,"threadID":3355,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1455294204,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>dann kp <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44011,"threadID":3355,"userID":1746,"username":"ArrowStorm","subject":"","time":1455294519,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44012,"threadID":3355,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1455294608,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1455297538,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn alles klappt, heute Abend gegen 19 Uhr~ gefixxt.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44013,"threadID":3355,"userID":1746,"username":"ArrowStorm","subject":"","time":1455294939,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wuhu <span class=\"missing-media\">[wow]</span>  <span class=\"missing-media\">[right*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44148,"threadID":3355,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1455631109,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wir arbeiten weiterhin mit Hochdruck an dem Problem und gehen zur Zeit jede erdenkliche Option durch.<br>Der Teamspeak³ Server wird bei jedem Crash neugestartet.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir bitten um etwas Geduld und entschuldigen uns für die Vorfälle.<br>Sobald alles wieder reibungslos funktioniert erwartet euch ein Entschädigungs-Event.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44149,"threadID":3355,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1455631724,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es gibt einen TS3-Exploit mit dem man einen Server &#x27;abstrüzen&#x27; lassen kann.. ohne das er wirklich Abstürzt.<br>Sollte zwar eigentlich seit 3.0.7 oder 3.0.8 der Serversoftware gefixxt sein.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44150,"threadID":3355,"userID":322,"username":"Bara","subject":"","time":1455631889,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es gibt genug Exploits.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> versuch eine andere Hardware (z.B. VPS).</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44151,"threadID":3355,"userID":2115,"username":"AiZy","subject":"","time":1455647342,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Oder im Startscript etwas ändern</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Und am besten über Putty starten</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":44188,"threadID":3355,"userID":2,"username":"Sky","subject":"","time":1455881893,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3382-teamspeak3-ip-fix/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[closesnew*]</span></p>","polls":[]}]}